      "created_at": "2018-07-02T13:13:12Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-07-02T13:24:53Z",
      "body": "@lmerriam  Do I need to remove user from DB or just deactivate him?\r\nArea (postal) code is stored in the Position model which has reference to weather model and it doesn't linked to the user itself. So can we keep it ? This could decrease the request amount to DB. Because many users could have the same  postal code.",
