      "created_at": "2018-07-07T13:29:35Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-07-07T13:30:20Z",
      "body": "@X-tina to clarify: we should not remove the postal code itself (as you say, other users depend on it) but we should remove the deleted user's **reference** to the code.\r\n\r\nEven though multiple users may have the same postal code, US privacy regulations say that any location more specific than Country is considered personally identifiable information, and we need to remove all personally identifiable info for users that choose to delete their accounts.",
